{"id":"ark-of-the-covenant","title":"The Ark of the Covenant","kind":"object","en":["ark of the covenant","ark of the testament"],"la":["arca foederis","arca testamenti"],"gist":"The gilded chest that held the tablets of the law, with the mercy seat on top, where God's presence met his people. It led them through the Jordan, fell into Philistine hands, and was brought to Jerusalem by David. The Fathers saw in it a sign of Mary, who carried the Word; Revelation shows the ark in heaven's temple.","original":"Hebrew aron berit.","passages":[{"ref":"Exodus 25:10-22","note":"How it was made."},{"ref":"2 Samuel 6:1-15","note":"David brings it to Jerusalem."},{"ref":"Luke 1:39-45","note":"The visitation echoes the ark's journey."},{"ref":"Revelation 11:19","note":"The ark seen in heaven."}],"related":["holy-of-holies"],"total":44,"byBook":{"1CH":9,"1KI":4,"1SA":3,"2CH":2,"2SA":2,"DEU":4,"EXO":1,"HEB":1,"JDG":1,"JER":1,"JOS":14,"NUM":2},"verses":["1CH.15.25","1CH.15.26","1CH.15.28","1CH.15.29","1CH.16.6","1CH.16.37","1CH.17.1","1CH.22.19","1CH.28.18","1KI.3.15","1KI.6.19","1KI.8.1","1KI.8.6","1SA.4.3","1SA.4.4","1SA.4.5","2CH.5.2","2CH.5.7","2SA.6.15","2SA.15.24","DEU.10.8","DEU.31.9","DEU.31.25","DEU.31.26","EXO.30.26","HEB.9.4","JDG.20.27","JER.3.16","JOS.3.3","JOS.3.6","JOS.3.8","JOS.3.11","JOS.3.14","JOS.3.17","JOS.4.7","JOS.4.9","JOS.4.16","JOS.4.18","JOS.6.4","JOS.6.6","JOS.6.8","JOS.8.33","NUM.10.33","NUM.14.44"]}